OL,3,GNEWSASchool therapy dog providing
OL,4,A'comfort' and company
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity set up in memory of a
OL,7,F14-year-old girl who took her own life
OL,8,Fis funding a therapy dog at her school
OL,9,Fwith the hope it will help children
OL,10,Fstruggling with their mental health.
OL,12,FSadie Reed, who died in February last
OL,13,Fyear, was a pupil at Netherhall School
OL,14,Fin Maryport, Cumbria.
OL,16,FHer family launched a foundation
OL,17,Fbearing her name and have donated
OL,18,F#5,000 to sponsor springer spaniel Gus
OL,19,Fas the 10-month-old puppy completes his
OL,20,Fassistance dog training.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
